WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.186 --> 00:00:14.290
&gt;&gt; Laura: ALL RIGHT, WELCOME

00:00:11.688 --> 00:00:15.458
BACK TO "THE INGRAHAM ANGLE".

00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:17.594
LAS VEGAS, ALMOST FOUR MONTHS

00:00:15.592 --> 00:00:19.062
AFTER THE DEADLY MASS SHOOTING,

00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:20.063
WORST IN AMERICAN HISTORY.

00:00:19.195 --> 00:00:20.430
WHY SO MANY UNANSWERED

00:00:20.196 --> 00:00:21.331
QUESTIONS?

00:00:20.563 --> 00:00:23.500
LET’S TURN TO A COUPLE OF

00:00:21.464 --> 00:00:26.269
EXPERTS TO BREAK IT DOWN.

00:00:23.633 --> 00:00:27.237
FORMER LAPD DETECTIVE MARK

00:00:26.403 --> 00:00:27.937
FUHRMAN, WHO BECAME A HOUSEHOLD

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.039
NAME DURING THE O.J. SIMPSON

00:00:28.071 --> 00:00:30.941
TRIAL.

00:00:29.172 --> 00:00:32.709
AND RANDY SUTTON, FORMER LT.

00:00:31.074 --> 00:00:33.577
WITH THE LAS VEGAS METROPOLITAN

00:00:32.842 --> 00:00:34.978
POLICE DEPARTMENT.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.646
GREAT TO SEE BOTH OF YOU.

00:00:35.111 --> 00:00:37.747
MARK, LET’S START WITH YOU.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.584
IT IS FOUR MONTHS, ALMOST, SINCE

00:00:37.881 --> 00:00:44.354
THE SHOOTING.

00:00:40.717 --> 00:00:46.056
WE’RE NOW ONLY HEARING THAT THEY

00:00:44.488 --> 00:00:48.492
MIGHT BE CHARGING ANOTHER

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:50.460
INDIVIDUAL AFTER WE’VE HEARD

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:52.663
ALMOST NOTHING FROM THE

00:00:50.594 --> 00:00:54.097
LAS VEGAS POLICE DEPARTMENT,

00:00:52.796 --> 00:00:57.167
AFTER THE PRESS HAD TO PRESS FOR

00:00:54.231 --> 00:00:57.701
A LOT OF THESE DOCUMENTS TO BE

00:00:57.301 --> 00:00:58.402
RELEASED.

00:00:57.835 --> 00:01:01.338
WHAT’S GOING HERE?

00:00:58.535 --> 00:01:02.973
&gt;&gt; WELL, LAURA, LET’S PAUSE FOR

00:01:01.472 --> 00:01:05.943
A SECOND AND UNDERSTAND THAT WE

00:01:03.107 --> 00:01:07.611
HAD 58 HOMICIDES, 58 INDIVIDUAL

00:01:06.076 --> 00:01:09.947
HOMICIDE INVESTIGATIONS.

00:01:07.745 --> 00:01:11.582
AND HUNDREDS OF PEOPLE THAT WERE

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.283
WOUNDED AND THAT HAD TO BE

00:01:11.715 --> 00:01:13.851
DOCUMENTED AND HANDLED BY THE

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:14.919
DETECTIVES.

00:01:13.984 --> 00:01:16.353
WE HAVEN’T HEARD FROM ONE

00:01:15.052 --> 00:01:17.755
DETECTIVE, WHICH IS UNFORTUNATE.

00:01:16.487 --> 00:01:19.056
LET’S LOOK AT SOME OF THE THINGS

00:01:17.888 --> 00:01:20.958
THAT HAD TO BE PROCESSED.

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:23.261
ONE IS DNA.

00:01:21.092 --> 00:01:24.862
IF THERE WAS DNA ON ANYTHING

00:01:23.394 --> 00:01:25.663
THAT PADDOCK HAND THALD WAS IN

00:01:24.996 --> 00:01:26.631
THAT ROOM, THEY PROBABLY PURSUED

00:01:25.796 --> 00:01:28.666
THAT.

00:01:26.764 --> 00:01:29.267
IT IS PROBABLY HIS GIRLFRIEND

00:01:28.799 --> 00:01:30.401
THAT, THEY’RE ACTUALLY

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.537
TARGETING.

00:01:30.535 --> 00:01:34.338
I DON’T THINK THAT’S GOING TO

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:38.343
SOLVE ANYTHING IN THIS CASE AS

00:01:34.472 --> 00:01:39.077
FAR AS WHY, THE MOTIVE, OR

00:01:38.476 --> 00:01:41.412
REALLY HOW PADDOCK PULLED THIS

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:43.081
OFF.

00:01:41.546 --> 00:01:45.550
&gt;&gt; Laura: RANDY, YOU ARE A

00:01:43.214 --> 00:01:46.484
VETERAN OF THE LAS VEGAS POLICE

00:01:45.683 --> 00:01:48.086
DEPARTMENT, I HAVE A COUPLE OF

00:01:46.617 --> 00:01:49.087
FRIENDS THAT YOU PROBABLY KNOW

00:01:48.219 --> 00:01:49.921
WHO ARE HOMICIDE DETECTIVES

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.122
THERE, JUST RETIRED A COUPLE OF

00:01:50.054 --> 00:01:53.725
YEARS AGO.

00:01:51.256 --> 00:01:54.993
AND IT’S A TIGHT KNIT GROUP AT

00:01:53.858 --> 00:01:57.796
THE LAS VEGAS POLICE.

00:01:55.126 --> 00:01:59.597
THEY DEAL WITH A LOT EVERY DAY.

00:01:57.929 --> 00:02:01.299
BUT THIS WAS SO HORRIFIC ON

00:01:59.731 --> 00:02:03.001
EVERY LEVEL.

00:02:01.433 --> 00:02:05.937
WHAT HAPPENS WHEN WE DON’T HAVE

00:02:03.134 --> 00:02:07.305
A REGULAR UPDATE, OR EVEN PRESS

00:02:06.071 --> 00:02:08.907
BRIEFINGS, I THINK, IN A CASE

00:02:07.439 --> 00:02:10.909
LIKE THIS IS THAT PEOPLE START

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.911
SAYING WHAT’S REALLY GOING ON.

00:02:11.042 --> 00:02:13.745
WELL WHY AREN’T WE SEEING --

00:02:13.044 --> 00:02:15.280
WHERE’S THE VIDEO OF HIM

00:02:13.879 --> 00:02:16.748
CHECKING INTO THE HOTEL.

00:02:15.414 --> 00:02:18.316
I’VE BEEN ASKING THIS QUESTION,

00:02:16.882 --> 00:02:21.553
MY PRODUCERS LAUGH AT ME, I ASK

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:23.689
THE QUESTION EVERY DAY, WHERE’S

00:02:21.687 --> 00:02:24.956
THE VIDEO OF STEVE GENERAL

00:02:23.822 --> 00:02:27.559
PADDOCK CHECKING INTO THE HOTEL.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:30.863
&gt;&gt; THERE’S A LOT GOING ON HERE.

00:02:27.693 --> 00:02:32.731
AND ONE OF THE THINGS THAT YOU

00:02:30.996 --> 00:02:37.603
PROBABLY HEARD, HAS BEEN

00:02:32.865 --> 00:02:38.704
UNEXAPPLICABLE TO ME, IS THAT

00:02:37.736 --> 00:02:40.906
METRO TOOK ON THIS INVESTIGATION

00:02:38.837 --> 00:02:42.941
AND THE SCOPE OF IT, OF COURSE,

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:45.611
IS HUGE, FOR SOME REASON A

00:02:43.075 --> 00:02:47.646
DECISION WAS MADE TO RELIEVE THE

00:02:45.744 --> 00:02:50.516
HOMICIDE UNIT OF THE

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:52.118
INVESTIGATION AND GIVE IT TO A

00:02:50.649 --> 00:02:52.751
RATHER INNOCUOUS UNIT THAT

00:02:52.251 --> 00:02:53.853
HANDLES OFFICER-INVOLVED

00:02:52.885 --> 00:02:55.221
SHOOTINGS.

00:02:53.986 --> 00:02:57.423
THAT’S ONE OF THE MAJOR

00:02:55.354 --> 00:02:59.125
QUESTIONS THAT I HAVE HAD.

00:02:57.556 --> 00:02:59.925
HERE’S THE THING, THE INITIAL

00:02:59.258 --> 00:03:02.294
LAW ENFORCEMENT RESPONSE WAS

00:03:00.059 --> 00:03:04.897
AMAZING.

00:03:02.428 --> 00:03:07.500
COURAGE THAT THESE OFFICERS

00:03:05.031 --> 00:03:10.870
SHOWED AND THE DEDICATION THEY

00:03:07.633 --> 00:03:12.972
SHOWED WAS ABSOLUTELY STUNNING.

00:03:11.003 --> 00:03:16.109
BUT THEN YOU HAVE THIS MEDIA

00:03:13.105 --> 00:03:16.809
BLACKOUT, AS YOU HAVE TERMED IT,

00:03:16.242 --> 00:03:19.178
AND IT’S VERY DIFFICULT TO

00:03:16.943 --> 00:03:20.480
UNDERSTAND.

00:03:19.312 --> 00:03:23.783
IT’S A LITTLE INEXPLICABLE TO

00:03:20.613 --> 00:03:25.084
ME, HOW THE SHERIFF HAS NOT BEEN

00:03:23.916 --> 00:03:26.819
KEEPING THE PUBLIC --

00:03:25.218 --> 00:03:28.788
&gt;&gt; Laura: I KNOW YOU AREN’T

00:03:26.953 --> 00:03:29.822
GOING TO SAY THIS, RANDY, BUT

00:03:28.922 --> 00:03:33.193
DID THEY SCREW UP?

00:03:29.956 --> 00:03:34.861
OR ARE THEY WORRIED THAT VEGAS,

00:03:33.326 --> 00:03:36.663
I MEAN, IT’S A PLACE THAT

00:03:34.994 --> 00:03:37.998
SURVIVES ON TOURISM.

00:03:36.796 --> 00:03:39.666
PEOPLE HAVE TO FEEL SAFE.

00:03:38.131 --> 00:03:41.501
THEY HAVE TO FEEL LIKE WHEN THEY

00:03:39.799 --> 00:03:43.303
CHECK INTO A HOTEL THERE’S NOT A

00:03:41.634 --> 00:03:44.304
GUY CHECKING TEN BAGS WITH

00:03:43.436 --> 00:03:45.005
THOUSANDS OF ROUNDS OF

00:03:44.437 --> 00:03:47.908
AMMUNITION IN THE NEXT HOTEL

00:03:45.138 --> 00:03:50.744
ROOM.

00:03:48.041 --> 00:03:51.444
I GET THESE CASINOS, THEY WANT

00:03:50.877 --> 00:03:51.845
TO BE THRIVING AND HIRING

00:03:51.578 --> 00:03:53.914
PEOPLE.

00:03:51.978 --> 00:03:57.084
I GET IT.

00:03:54.047 --> 00:03:58.986
I FIND THIS WOULD BE REALLY ODD.

00:03:57.217 --> 00:04:00.988
FRANKLY, INFURIATING, WE GOT THE

00:03:59.119 --> 00:04:02.556
BIG BRUSHOFF FROM THE POLICE

00:04:01.121 --> 00:04:04.858
TODAY, WE’RE BIG SUPPORTERS OF

00:04:02.689 --> 00:04:05.859
THE POLICE, BIG BRUSHOFF.

00:04:04.992 --> 00:04:07.528
WHAT DO YOU MEAN YOU’RE NOT

00:04:05.993 --> 00:04:08.395
GOING TO TALK ABOUT IT?

00:04:07.661 --> 00:04:09.797
WE AREN’T ASKING YOU TO XREE HIZ

00:04:08.529 --> 00:04:11.665
THE INVESTIGATION.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:13.600
WHY DO WE KNOW SO LITTLE ABOUT

00:04:11.799 --> 00:04:15.402
HIS MOVEMENTS INSIDE THAT HOTEL,

00:04:13.734 --> 00:04:16.670
NO ONE EVER WENT INSIDE THE

00:04:15.536 --> 00:04:19.306
HOTEL CAN HIM, NO ONE CAME IN

00:04:16.804 --> 00:04:20.741
AND OUT, NO MAIDS?

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:23.177
WHERE’S THAT SECURITY GUARD, HE

00:04:20.874 --> 00:04:26.647
WAS ON "ELLEN," HE DID ONE

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:27.581
APPEARANCE ON "ELLEN," HE HAS

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.682
SOME DEAL WITH THE MANDALAY BAY

00:04:27.715 --> 00:04:32.386
HOTEL.

00:04:28.816 --> 00:04:32.787
&gt;&gt; DID THE POLICE SCREW UP, NO,

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.421
THEY DIDN’T.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.222
THEY HAVE HANDLED THIS

00:04:33.554 --> 00:04:37.024
INVESTIGATION AT THE INITIAL

00:04:35.356 --> 00:04:38.459
OUTSET, WITH THE PROFESSIONALISM

00:04:37.158 --> 00:04:41.429
THAT ONE WOULD EXPECT.

00:04:38.592 --> 00:04:43.264
HOWEVER, YOU KNOW, WHEN YOU TALK

00:04:41.562 --> 00:04:45.166
ABOUT GIVING THE RESPONSIBILITY

00:04:43.397 --> 00:04:46.167
OF THIS INVESTIGATION TO THE

00:04:45.299 --> 00:04:48.035
PROPER AUTHORITIES, WELL THAT

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.303
WOULD BE THE HOMICIDE UNIT.

00:04:48.169 --> 00:04:50.738
&gt;&gt; Laura: THOSE GUYS ARE GREAT,

00:04:49.437 --> 00:04:51.439
I KNOW THEM, GREAT GUYS.

00:04:50.872 --> 00:04:53.207
I HAVE TO GET FUHRMAN IN ON

00:04:51.572 --> 00:04:55.076
THIS.

00:04:53.341 --> 00:04:55.877
MARK, I DON’T -- I’M A BIG

00:04:55.209 --> 00:04:57.812
SUPPORTER OF THE POLICE,

00:04:56.010 --> 00:05:00.415
EVERYONE KNOWS THAT.

00:04:57.946 --> 00:05:05.620
BUT THIS WAS, WE HAVE 58

00:05:00.548 --> 00:05:07.121
AMERICANS DEAD, WE HAD 498

00:05:05.753 --> 00:05:08.289
INJURED, WE’RE NOT GOING TO

00:05:07.255 --> 00:05:09.023
RELEASE THIS SEARCH WARRANT, NOT

00:05:08.423 --> 00:05:10.458
GOING TO RELEASE THAT SEARCH

00:05:09.157 --> 00:05:12.327
WARRANT.

00:05:10.592 --> 00:05:14.462
WE HAVE ONE WOMAN WHO GOT PAID

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:16.698
MONEY WHILE THIS THING WAS

00:05:14.596 --> 00:05:18.667
HAPPENING, HE WIRED HER MONEY,

00:05:16.831 --> 00:05:20.402
SHE DELETED HER FACEBOOK

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:22.003
ACCOUNT, BEFORE HIS NAME WAS

00:05:20.535 --> 00:05:23.271
RELEASED TO THE PUBLIC SHE’S

00:05:22.137 --> 00:05:25.640
DELETING FACEBOOK ACCOUNTS.

00:05:23.405 --> 00:05:27.509
THAT WAS ODD.

00:05:25.774 --> 00:05:29.010
&gt;&gt; WELL, LAURA, RANDY IS

00:05:27.642 --> 00:05:31.213
ABSOLUTELY CORRECT, I THINK IT’S

00:05:29.144 --> 00:05:33.749
SLAP IN THE FACE OF THE HOMICIDE

00:05:31.346 --> 00:05:35.417
DETECTIVES THAT DO THIS FOR A

00:05:33.882 --> 00:05:36.918
LIVING, OFFICER-INVOLVED

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:38.887
SHOOTING TEAM DEAL WITH DEATHS

00:05:37.052 --> 00:05:40.022
BUT USUALLY INVOLVES OFFICERS.

00:05:39.021 --> 00:05:42.824
I’M SURE THAT THE THOUGHT

00:05:40.155 --> 00:05:45.494
PROCESS WAS THAT THEY HANDLE A

00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:48.363
LOT OF BALLISTICS AND A LOT OF

00:05:45.627 --> 00:05:50.032
TRACKING, THE PATH OF BULLETS,

00:05:48.497 --> 00:05:51.100
THEY WOULD BE BETTER, I GUESS,

00:05:50.165 --> 00:05:52.568
INFORMED TO HANDLE THIS SINCE

00:05:51.233 --> 00:05:55.170
THE SHOOTER IS DEAD.

00:05:52.701 --> 00:05:56.405
THAT BEING SAID, THE ONE THING I

00:05:55.304 --> 00:05:58.040
DIDN’T LIKE ABOUT THIS

00:05:56.538 --> 00:05:59.842
INVESTIGATION, YOU HAD TOO MANY

00:05:58.173 --> 00:06:02.444
HEAVIES, TOO MANY CHIEFS, TOO

00:05:59.975 --> 00:06:03.846
MANY FROM THE BIG TOWER TALKING

00:06:02.578 --> 00:06:05.181
IN THESE PRESS CONFERENCES

00:06:03.979 --> 00:06:05.614
INSTEAD PEOPLE THAT DO THIS FOR

00:06:05.314 --> 00:06:07.750
A LIVING.

00:06:05.748 --> 00:06:10.319
I THINK THAT’S ONE OF THE THINGS

00:06:07.883 --> 00:06:12.021
THAT BECAME A MISTAKE THAT NOW

00:06:10.453 --> 00:06:14.457
WE DON’T HAVE THAT INFORMATION,

00:06:12.154 --> 00:06:16.525
WE ALSO HAVE CIVIL LITIGATION,

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:18.394
WE HAVE HUNDREDS OF CIVIL

00:06:16.659 --> 00:06:19.729
LAWSUITS THAT ARE UNDOUBTEDLY

00:06:18.527 --> 00:06:22.532
WE’RE LOOKING AT.

00:06:19.862 --> 00:06:24.700
THE CITY OF LAS VEGAS, MANDALAY

00:06:22.665 --> 00:06:26.435
BAY, THE POLICE DEPARTMENT, EVEN

00:06:24.834 --> 00:06:28.304
THOUGH I BELIEVE JUST LIKE

00:06:26.569 --> 00:06:30.339
RANDY, THE POLICE DEPARTMENT DID

00:06:28.438 --> 00:06:31.808
NOTHING, THEY HAD SUCH A SMALL

00:06:30.473 --> 00:06:34.377
WINDOW TO ACTUALLY ACT.

00:06:31.941 --> 00:06:36.145
AND I THINK THEY DID IT AS HE’S

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:37.981
PUT, BRAVELY AND HEROICALLY,

00:06:36.279 --> 00:06:40.116
THEY ACTUALLY CLOSED AS FAST AS

00:06:38.114 --> 00:06:42.619
THEY COULD WITH THE SUSPECT.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:45.421
BUT MANDALAY BAY AND LAS VEGAS

00:06:42.752 --> 00:06:46.456
AND AN ELECTED OFFICIAL THAT’S

00:06:45.555 --> 00:06:48.324
HANDLING THE INVESTIGATION AS

00:06:46.589 --> 00:06:51.761
SHERIFF, I THINK THERE’S A LOT

00:06:48.458 --> 00:06:52.062
OF UNSAID POLITICS GOING ON

00:06:51.895 --> 00:06:52.762
HERE.

00:06:52.195 --> 00:06:53.697
&gt;&gt; Laura: BINGO, FOLLOW THE

00:06:52.896 --> 00:06:54.664
MONEY.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.865
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE THEY’RE JUST

00:06:54.798 --> 00:06:57.567
SLOWING IT DOWN.

00:06:55.999 --> 00:06:59.870
&gt;&gt; Laura: FOLLOW THE MONEY.

00:06:57.701 --> 00:07:04.441
&gt;&gt; THERE’S NO DOUBT IN MY MIND,

00:07:00.003 --> 00:07:05.509
NO DOUBT IN MY MIND THE MANDALAY

00:07:04.574 --> 00:07:06.543
BAY IS THE ONE CONTROLLING --

00:07:05.642 --> 00:07:07.878
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE INFORMATION FLOW.

00:07:06.676 --> 00:07:09.179
&gt;&gt; ESPECIALLY WHEN IT COMES TO

00:07:08.011 --> 00:07:12.282
THE EMPLOYEE, CAMPOS.

00:07:09.312 --> 00:07:14.952
I MEAN, HE DISAPPEARED AFTER

